00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:01,000
Fly away home.

2
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:56,000
Lady Bird is a drama, comedy film directed by Greta Gerwig.

3
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:51,000
Lady Bird McPherson, a strong willed, deeply opinionated,
artistic 17 year old comes of age in Sacramento.

4
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:46,000
Her relationship with her mother and her upbringing are questioned
and tested as she plans to head off to college.

5
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:41,000
Lady Bird McPherson, played by Saoirse Ronan.

6
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:36,000
Marion McPherson, played by Laurie Metcalf.

7
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:31,000
Larry McPherson, played by Tracy Letts.

8
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:26,000
